  "releaseNotes": "Localize public core enum captions with Display resources\nPreserve protection across repeated setup and position cycles\nInitialize high-level subscription processing when started\nUnwind the blocking waits left by the async rework and fix what it uncovered\nMark the blocking wrappers obsolete\nAdd walk-forward optimization, a market profile, three statistics and candle spread options\nMove instrument lookups and persistence to async\nBuild a position's risk message only when a rule will check it\nReport the emulated account to the connector, floating profit included\nStamp a statistics observation with the clock the strategy runs on\nCheck that values do something, not merely that they travel\nGive a strategy the volume that turns its position around\nCount and walk an optimization parameter before it exists\nFix strategy order position and protection flows\nUpdated Ecng.GeneticSharp to 1.0.6.",
